marta: FYI I opened a PR to unify the structured-output examples with the function/tool-calling migration notes: https://github.com/redwood-inference/docs/pull/523

owen: thanks. quick ask: show both named-arg (object) and positional-arg (array) examples, and include a validator-friendly JSON Schema users can copy.

nia: agree. also flag: several docs still use `toolName` and `function_call.name`. we should standardize on `tool` and add a short compatibility note.

marta: yep. draft schema below — please sanity-check before I push to the PR: ```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "tool": {"type": "string"},
    "args": {"oneOf":[{"type":"object"},{"type":"array"}]},
    "confidence": {"type":"number","minimum":0,"maximum":1},
    "meta": {"type":"object"}
  },
  "required": ["tool","args"],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

owen: looks good. add one concrete enum example for `url_fetch` and `db_query` so teams can validate specific tools.

nia: parsing snippets: add JS and Python minimal patterns. JS example: ```js
const out = await client.generate(prompt);
const parsed = JSON.parse(out.output);
const {tool, args} = parsed;
if (tool === 'url_fetch') await fetch(args.url);
```

marta: Python example (pydantic style) added in the PR. also included a short mapper for legacy shape: "Map `function_call.name` -> `tool`, and `function_call.arguments` -> `args`."

owen: also call out that `confidence` is advisory. text suggestion: "Confidence is model-provided and may not be calibrated; validate against domain heuristics or your evals before automated actions." Link that to /guides/evals.

nia: snippet-checker flagged a broken internal link in the guide (referenced `/sdk/python/old-tooling`). Marta, can you replace with `/sdk/python/migration#tool-calls` and add a redirect PR for the old path?

marta: will do. I'll open a tiny redirect PR to `_redirects.yml` and tag marketing.

sdk-bot: CI: docs lint + snippet tests passed for PR #523  3 files changed, 14 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)  https://ci.internal/redwood/523 :white_check_mark:

owen: final reviewer? I can take one last pass after you push the schema updates, marta.

marta: thanks — pushing updates in ~20m, target merge by EOD. Appreciate the quick turnaround! :rocket:
